WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.490
Built around your drawer. A source-led assembly concept • E900BP

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.490
Every part has a purpose. Pre-installed hardware is shown in place. Green nylon connectors; metallic spring pins.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.490
Align. Insert. Engage. Align all connections together before seating the frame.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.490
Install the sub-front separately. Align the upper pivot pins, then seat the sub-front in its open position.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.490
Add the bottom support. Align the support hardware with the rear receiving locations.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.490
Slide the bottom into its grooves. The sub-front stays open on its upper pivot pins.

7
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.490
Rotate the sub-front closed. The upper pins form the pivot; the lower pins return into the notches.

8
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:40.490
Connect the finished front. Insert all channel locks, pause, then slide the finished front straight down.

9
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.490
Ready for the next connection. Explore this drawer style with Lockdowel.
